\item the lode guidance options (\code{zigzag}, \code{zagzig}, \code{forward} (alias
\code{rightward}), \code{backward} (alias \code{leftward}), \code{frontback} (alias
\code{rightleft}), and \code{backfront} (alias \code{leftright}): concatenate the per-axis
orderings in the corresponding lode guidance pattern, starting from the
axis at position \code{start}. When not explicitly passed, the default \code{start}
position depends on the guidance pattern: the middle axis (rounded down)
for \code{zagzig} and \code{frontback}, the middle axis (rounded up) for \code{zigzag} and
\code{backfront}, the first axis for \code{forward}, and the last axis for
